<title>UK: Kredietbank sets 2.0 bln Lux franc seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>Kredietbank sets 2.0 bln Lux franc seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Kredietbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   Kredietbank SA LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON    *5.00	MATURITY    23.JUL.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  102.75    PAY DATE 22/23.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     YIELD	5.15	SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K)   50-250</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 PRAECIPUUM 0.25</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR FIRST FOUR YEARS THEN STEPS-UP TO 6.625 PCT</p>
<p>		 THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
